                {
                  "id": "azure-data-factory.p2",
                  "title": "Azure Data Factory - Copy, Parameters & Monitoring",
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "role": "title",
                      "text": "Azure Data Factory - Copy, Parameters & Monitoring",
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 38,
                        "minFontSize": 29,
                        "overflow": "shrink",
                        "lineHeight": 1.16
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.title"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "role": "section",
                      "text": "5. Copy Activity",
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 27,
                        "minFontSize": 23,
                        "overflow": "shrink",
                        "lineHeight": 1.2
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.s1"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Source dataset in, sink dataset out. Everything else is throughput and fault tolerance.",
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 21,
                        "lineHeight": 1.32
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.b1"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "list",
                      "items": [
                        [
                          {
                            "text": "DIU",
                            "marks": [
                              "key"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " - Data Integration Units - cloud copy power, 2-256."
                          }
                        ],
                        [
                          {
                            "text": "Parallel copies",
                            "marks": [
                              "key"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " - concurrent readers per activity run."
                          }
                        ],
                        [
                          {
                            "text": "Staged copy",
                            "marks": [
                              "key"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "text": " - via blob; required for PolyBase into Synapse."
                          }
                        ],
                        "Fault tolerance can skip incompatible rows and log them."
                      ],
                      "gap": 13.256666666666652,
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 21,
                        "lineHeight": 1.32,
                        "overflow": "shrink",
                        "minFontSize": 20
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.b2"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "role": "section",
                      "text": "6. Parameterization",
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 27,
                        "minFontSize": 23,
                        "overflow": "shrink",
                        "lineHeight": 1.2
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.s2"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Four scopes, one expression language. Knowing which scope a value lives in is most of the battle.",
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 21,
                        "lineHeight": 1.32
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.b3"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "list",
                      "items": [
                        "Parameters are set at start and immutable; variables are mutable.",
                        "Pass values down with Execute Pipeline, never through globals."
                      ],
                      "gap": 19.769999999999968,
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 21,
                        "lineHeight": 1.32,
                        "overflow": "shrink",
                        "minFontSize": 20
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.b4"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "role": "section",
                      "text": "7. Monitoring",
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 27,
                        "minFontSize": 23,
                        "overflow": "shrink",
                        "lineHeight": 1.2
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.s3"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Monitor hub -> pipeline runs -> activity runs. Rerun from the failed activity, not from the top.",
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 21,
                        "lineHeight": 1.32
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.b5"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "list",
                      "items": [
                        "Run history is kept 45 days - ship to Log Analytics for longer.",
                        "Annotations are the only practical way to filter runs at scale.",
                        "Alert on Failed pipeline runs, and on activity duration for silent stalls."
                      ],
                      "gap": 14.884999999999948,
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 21,
                        "lineHeight": 1.32,
                        "overflow": "shrink",
                        "minFontSize": 20
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.b6"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "role": "section",
                      "text": "8. Traps Worth Memorising",
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 27,
                        "minFontSize": 23,
                        "overflow": "shrink",
                        "lineHeight": 1.2
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.s4"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "list",
                      "items": [
                        "A Lookup activity returns at most 5 000 rows / 4 MB.",
                        "ForEach inside ForEach is not allowed - use a child pipeline.",
                        "Debug runs use the debug IR and ignore triggers.",
                        "Deleting a linked service does not warn about dependent datasets."
                      ],
                      "gap": 13.256666666666641,
                      "style": {
                        "fontSize": 21,
                        "lineHeight": 1.32,
                        "overflow": "shrink",
                        "minFontSize": 20
                      },
                      "id": "azure-data-factory.p2.b7"
                    },
